      "role": "user",
      "content": "Wait, you cut off at the end there. \"Speaking of w...\"? what were you saying? also, i'm a bit worried about finding any hidden issues in the wood itself once i get it installed. how do i know the beam is actually as solid as it looks?",
      "source": "evaluator"
